  <item>
    <title>【EP.18】对谈“新世相”：我这二十年的生命之路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b3c8fdb715a238c0727fbb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b3c8fdb715a238c0727fbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【聊天的人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>张伟（新世相创始人）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPlEtBEsBUuMZFGmpJNaYf4FB8u.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 1：初进德云社</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> 因为热爱加入德云社</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">06:23</a> 德云社破除了相声选拔的门阀制度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 白天工程师白领，晚上擦桌子扫地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 曾被德云社开除过，这是唯一一次求人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> “格调不高的包袱咱不使”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 演员到最后演的只有自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> 郭德纲老师给我最大的教育：坚持做事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 人最大的问题是在自负和自卑中找到平衡点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1262">21:02</a> 被逼到墙角，开始全职说相声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 35岁放弃国企工作，辞职说相声</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 2：郭麒麟和脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1454">24:14</a>“我们这行好搭档胜似夫妻两口子”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a> 和郭麒麟的一次坦诚聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> “如果大林还说相声，我就还说，如果大林不说，我也不会再找别人搭档”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 和郭麒麟：私下没有交集，君子之交淡如水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2148">35:48</a> “郭麒麟是我的处境”背后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">37:16</a> “脱口秀里写的是我这20年的全部”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> 最好的东西是真诚</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 3：人生就是绝境之后还有绝境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">40:04</a> 感受到自己老了的一刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2531">42:11</a> &nbsp;42岁路走绝了，开始骑行周游世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2789">46:29</a> 到了物理上的绝境，山穷水尽疑无路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2918">48:38</a> 骑行不是一件浪漫的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3036">50:36</a> &nbsp;人生绝境的绝境：脱口秀说不动，sketch写不出，进入了一个新的自我否定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3247">54:07</a> 捧哏和逗哏，作品和伙伴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3631">01:00:31</a> 没法用幽默和调侃来面对自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3822">01:03:42</a> “我非常恐惧失控感”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4168">01:09:28</a> 接受自己是个普通人：我逗不乐年轻人了，但能继续往前走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4394">01:13:14</a> 当你站在起点的时候，它最难的过程已经结束了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4498">01:14:58</a> 人生中总有一件事你不能糊弄它</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/670e3fac0d2f24f2894a0b6f/lqZ6fzRgjPMU6vLmank8tVLp4Sll.m4a" length="72778778" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsoHFuXf6WGhpZiLHtB8jygLO6fq.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
