  <item>
    <title>【EP.13】南非滞留走夜道 开着哈雷听单弦儿（我的摩托日记・非洲篇①）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fbf108623bc78c3968437f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fbf108623bc78c3968437f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阎鹤祥</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> </span></strong><span>关于拖更俩月 你听我跟你解释</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a></span></strong><span> 伺候您一段“全球摩旅”《地理图》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 巴以冲突对我的骑行计划影响至今</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 《喜人》初舞台后心灰意冷马上买机票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 抵达南非开普敦 非洲摩旅开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> 等取车过程中在开普敦的见闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 开着哈雷听单弦儿，那叫一个地道儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 一个从小爱看交通工具的小孩儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3570">59:30</a> 在南非走夜路 那是真瘆人哪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3705">01:01:45</a> 令人困惑的南非麦当劳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">01:06:00</a> 错过关曼德拉的罗本岛 好在没错过好望角的鸵鸟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu-_vFa3B8PiwotvBaJz-BLYYwik.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjypKRIDuIUsQrIHlCvS5Q6vOncB.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTphhVaOJxU7ZnDXeUHFI5xalcE.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsph4GxPmvQamlzij4JhCINrvqyl.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnqsUIORrdxAWu0YVHTwQGrbKwTS.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flje8pdh13nZ0iEqL-cr6guVMDAS.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FomZfILcXt6cQzMWL4V1GYnT6p7J.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FinTy5W1Fz4lsdoDM56HMyM3Aotr.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>【ED】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Circle Of Life - Hans Zimmer</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑・制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如（番薯剥壳工作室）</span></p>]]></description>
