  <item>
    <title>【EP.10】制作人在线“催更”：直面对喜剧的真实感受 尽力保持“表达”的能力与欲望</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6795473fd74435e4a3c46783</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6795473fd74435e4a3c46783</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jan 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【聊天的人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>阎鹤祥</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如（播客《井户端会议》、《东亚观察局》主播、番薯工作室主理人）</span></p><span></span><p><span>*阎鹤祥与梵一如串台的另外一部分和春节有关的内容请移步至《井户端会议》收听：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6795212c247d51713c47bb90" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6795212c247d51713c47bb90">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 停更三周，制作人替听众在线催更</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 正视这件事：我可能真的对喜剧没多大兴趣了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 那些闪耀星空的艺人们会如何克服自己的“危机”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 艺人最累的时候也是最被需要的时候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 计划春节后非洲骑行 完成全球拼图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 特别想自己做一个旅行类的节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> 开B站啦：啥都想试试感受一下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 形式其实不重要，你得有内容啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 不同平台的不同内容尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 身份尴尬，不敢对公共议题发表意见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 资深主播面对网暴负评的心态变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 我想跟老多喜欢的人聊天录播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>刀剑如梦 - 周华健</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑・制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如（番薯工作室）</span></p>]]></description>
