  <item>
    <title>【EP.08】身心俱疲抵南美 接二连三碰意外 旅途must go on！（我的《摩托日记》②）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6766e4661e823e72d3a96d9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6766e4661e823e72d3a96d9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Dec 2024 17:20:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】阎鹤祥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 抱歉拖更，实在是因为真工作忙+病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 做播客依然有不适应的地方期待未来能克服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 明年纪念师爷金文声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 去走访 去触摸 去尽量离得近一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> “摩托日记”书接上回：进入厄瓜多尔，故事才开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 到达南美第一时间确认漩涡的方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 劳累+复阳，整个人状态堪忧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> 事故意外接二连三，喘不过气了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> 居然被请进局子里被警察围观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a> 身心俱疲地睡去，烦躁吵闹地醒来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3630">1:00:30</a> 厄瓜多尔与秘鲁边检处有够简陋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3945">1:05:45</a> 就差一步！边境官临时叫住我想干嘛？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FicsvRJ1-Fgr6eRESPjbCvZTDcce.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>秘鲁与厄瓜多尔简陋的边检站</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FozYT5B5QpMjTy7Y4PYLZdHyTKR-.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>腰疼，休息只能席地而坐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fren79_ojF0yA2wU0qSraxL96nxi.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>餐馆老板娘和女儿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FswyRuP5IKne_lREJEbGotEI1wXE.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>路边冷饮店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtLMlrGglyHfn3ksordOlvIyZfgM.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>与边检警察合影</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpiKxn4LwNUIskPCA-zDZeMsQ-fs.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>很好吃的马查拉海鲜饭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs-yhauqobAfzlL3diU2QALp1xne.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>南太平洋的第一顿早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Raphaël Beau - Micmacs à la gare</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑・制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如（番薯剥壳工作室）</span></p>]]></description>
