  <item>
    <title>【EP.06】也许每段生命之旅都需要一个糟糕的开始（我的《摩托日记》①）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6749a71bc3b2a2f3346c5a9d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6749a71bc3b2a2f3346c5a9d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Nov 2024 11:46:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】阎鹤祥</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 又是一年纲丝节，听我跟你聊聊骑行美洲吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 美洲骑行版《地理图》 &nbsp;听我这段贯口行不行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 计划赶不上变化 后半年骑行计划差点难产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 从纲丝节到南美，史上最夸张的赶场之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 唯一解：北京-巴黎-亚特兰大-基多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 屋漏偏逢连阴雨 飞亚特兰大变备降波士顿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 您猜怎么着？说到现在我的噩梦才刚刚开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a> 狠心花巨款住胶囊仓 半夜还被吓醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3225">53:45</a> 心力憔悴之下，想起指引我的切·格瓦拉</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>张广天 - 《切·格瓦拉》主题歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑・制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如（番薯剥壳工作室）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlGJjOFWcQ-x9g6NYeCh2EUZV_Ci.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>2023年“纲丝节”现场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhOBwb_imYS0OLm2HCLQOIpbOcKy.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>启程赴南美</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flr9vHRI27SdeJtT1leq8TsChYD7.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>航线变动飞往波士顿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuHfTuPxecm7ZsDpa06vk3WbAAcZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>花巨款住进胶囊仓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj0AcrJTeNyrn6IhwzXrtxumX5N7.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>机场抵墙睡的乘客</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh-v-y8fJnVMH4xfKtvXqbAlcnbi.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>飞机飞经佛罗里达和加勒比海</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgRkNe8QoEf1vSF8le_IacnfEpXO.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>电影《摩托日记》海报</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvFKYdGCj1lGYxTBoWLsV0697DCA.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>切·格瓦拉当年骑行路线</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqvJY3sBtN6oUtHTVqO1WFJJmAe2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>切·格瓦拉</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltluI6n_ZKom9pP2NCN0qht0Doc5.m4a" length="56390386" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsoHFuXf6WGhpZiLHtB8jygLO6fq.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【EP.05】长沙马王堆、青岛海员俱乐部，故事发生在1984年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673ee6328d1233fb0dea3a18</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673ee6328d1233fb0dea3a18</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Nov 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】阎鹤祥</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> 长沙美食到了next level</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> 省医看病、马王堆、笑嘛喜剧…这都不挨着！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 青岛里院喜剧节之行勾起我的思绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 那是在1984年，青岛办了场相声研讨会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 奇志和大兵的相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 四十年过去了，师爷我有话想跟您说</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiQqxQnPtG1PC3DVrgsGsVTo3LN4.HEIC"></figure><span></span><p><span>长沙美食</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgA9ElA1EwSJ_KsyZQWJMTWNEPtD.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>马王堆汉墓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fudb4kPPK3rx90PtySDpC5VM40qi.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>青岛劈柴院剧场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlAbvsBXm4kXaJP75sE-bLo9EyXp.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>青岛新疆路10号（现在）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3v552myC_R8-Q71JT5P7cg3EA2.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>青岛国际海员俱乐部（历史照片）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhEJE2oY_pRJkMM-wu49gb8ovOpZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>1984年青岛相声研讨会合影留念</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FowNmJf2oC17WalWdC5u8hzxQIJ_.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>1984年青岛相声研讨会获奖演出名单</span></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑・制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>梵一如（番薯剥壳工作室）</span></p>]]></description>
